{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/5cb6ba0407354dc438b0e069ef908eb1.poster.avif?t=1757582884\" width=780 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/5cb6ba0407354dc438b0e069ef908eb1.webm?t=1757582884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO CONTENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you have a <strong>limited set of questions</strong> (300+), and <u><strong>only the online mode</strong></u>. The full set of questions (1000+) and the <strong>local mode</strong> will be available in the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO KNOWS YOU BEST?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The You Quiz\u00a0</strong>is a <strong>multiplayer party game</strong>\u00a0designed for <strong>3 to 8 players</strong>. <br>Perfect for game nights with friends or family, it also works great as an icebreaker at social gatherings!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ASYMMETRICAL PARTY GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player gets to be the King. Everyone else? Courtiers desperate for approval.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE COURTIER'S TASK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/25cae1b5fe4fbab7a3c8e266fe72ea86.poster.avif?t=1757582884\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/25cae1b5fe4fbab7a3c8e266fe72ea86.webm?t=1757582884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/25cae1b5fe4fbab7a3c8e266fe72ea86.mp4?t=1757582884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess the King\u2019s opinion on personal, weird, or hilarious prompts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhat's King's unpopular opinion?\u201d<br>\u201cIt's the end of the world. What is King's first reaction?\u201d<br>\u201cName three things King hates:\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/e97ea1beed293f0369989efa63de4f41.poster.avif?t=1757582884\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/e97ea1beed293f0369989efa63de4f41.webm?t=1757582884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/e97ea1beed293f0369989efa63de4f41.mp4?t=1757582884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better know your friend! Answer with insight, flattery, or playful nonsense. Whatever makes them feel seen, smile, laugh, or glow with pride.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE KING DECIDES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/e1a4f8661d38f133aa6ac1f3926c1816.poster.avif?t=1757582884\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/e1a4f8661d38f133aa6ac1f3926c1816.webm?t=1757582884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/e1a4f8661d38f133aa6ac1f3926c1816.mp4?t=1757582884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the King, you judge every answer:<br>\ud83d\udc4e Meh? Reject it.<br>\ud83d\udc4d Pretty good? One step forward.<br>\u2764\ufe0f Nailed it? Two steps up the stairs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/e573bed14027849fd12c6cfbe7d6332c.poster.avif?t=1757582884\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/e573bed14027849fd12c6cfbe7d6332c.webm?t=1757582884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/e573bed14027849fd12c6cfbe7d6332c.mp4?t=1757582884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your court, your rules. Reward brilliance. Punish mediocrity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DETHRONE THE KING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/fa1be2b8568b33cc2477e0b7663e3381.poster.avif?t=1757582884\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/fa1be2b8568b33cc2477e0b7663e3381.webm?t=1757582884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/fa1be2b8568b33cc2477e0b7663e3381.mp4?t=1757582884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First to reach the top of the stairs steals the crown. Then they become the new King!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND YOUR TITLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each game, players earn titles that match their vibe.<br>Were you the <strong><i>Don Juan</i></strong>? The <strong><i>Emperor</i></strong>? The <strong><i>Jealous</i></strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 30+ titles! Bragging rights included.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO FEATURES LIST</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ questions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless game mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ titles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IN THE FULL GAME ONLY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local mode (with phone as controller)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1000+ questions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ playable characters</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967010?t=1757582884","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/43c3c8e67646cca8b1b017cd6f86d70b2e39f2e5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757582884","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/0624ab72df9fea7bd1680862413842f3be5d70fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757582884","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/0624ab72df9fea7bd1680862413842f3be5d70fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757582884","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967010/extras/5cb6ba0407354d